{"id":"bc892e1ba0a8566f","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-localization.md","title":"Localization","display":"df-localization — Localization","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-localization","aliases":["58-df-localization"],"display":"df-localization — Localization","depends_on":["[[58-df-multiplicative-set]]","[[58-df-ring]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-localization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-localization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-localization — Localization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6db02e65bcb543bc\" href=\"?note=6db02e65bcb543bc\" title=\"58-df-multiplicative-set\">58-df-multiplicative-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1c30d21ea7b443f6\" href=\"?note=1c30d21ea7b443f6\" title=\"58-df-ring\">58-df-ring</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\">\\((R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\)</span> (commutative ring, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1c30d21ea7b443f6\" href=\"?note=1c30d21ea7b443f6\" title=\"58-df-ring\">58-df-ring</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq R\">\\(S\\subseteq R\\)</span> (multiplicative set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6db02e65bcb543bc\" href=\"?note=6db02e65bcb543bc\" title=\"58-df-multiplicative-set\">58-df-multiplicative-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r,r&#39;\\in R\">\\(r,r&#39;\\in R\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,s&#39;\\in S\">\\(s,s&#39;\\in S\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sim_S\">\\(\\sim_S\\)</span> (localization equivalence relation)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}localization\\text{-}setup} \\vdash \\operatorname{LocalizationSetup}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R,S)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\land \\operatorname{MultiplicativeSet}_S(S;R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}localization\\text{-}setup} \\vdash \\operatorname{LocalizationSetup}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R,S)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\land \\operatorname{MultiplicativeSet}_S(S;R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}localization\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\operatorname{LocalizationSetup}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R,S)\\land r,r&#39;\\in R\\land s,s&#39;\\in S\\to\\left(\\langle r,s\\rangle\\sim_S\\langle r&#39;,s&#39;\\rangle\\leftrightarrow\\exists t\\in S\\;\\left(t\\cdot(r\\cdot s&#39;-r&#39;\\cdot s)=0_R\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}localization\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\operatorname{LocalizationSetup}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R,S)\\land r,r&#39;\\in R\\land s,s&#39;\\in S\\to\\left(\\langle r,s\\rangle\\sim_S\\langle r&#39;,s&#39;\\rangle\\leftrightarrow\\exists t\\in S\\;\\left(t\\cdot(r\\cdot s&#39;-r&#39;\\cdot s)=0_R\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}localization\\text{-}carrier} \\vdash \\operatorname{LocalizationSetup}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R,S)\\to S^{-1}R\\coloneqq(R\\times S)/\\sim_S\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}localization\\text{-}carrier} \\vdash \\operatorname{LocalizationSetup}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R,S)\\to S^{-1}R\\coloneqq(R\\times S)/\\sim_S\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}localization\\text{-}operations} \\vdash \\operatorname{LocalizationSetup}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R,S)\\land r,r&#39;\\in R\\land s,s&#39;\\in S\\to\\left(\\frac{r}{s}+\\frac{r&#39;}{s&#39;}=\\frac{r\\cdot s&#39;+r&#39;\\cdot s}{s\\cdot s&#39;}\\land\\frac{r}{s}\\cdot\\frac{r&#39;}{s&#39;}=\\frac{r\\cdot r&#39;}{s\\cdot s&#39;}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}localization\\text{-}operations} \\vdash \\operatorname{LocalizationSetup}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R,S)\\land r,r&#39;\\in R\\land s,s&#39;\\in S\\to\\left(\\frac{r}{s}+\\frac{r&#39;}{s&#39;}=\\frac{r\\cdot s&#39;+r&#39;\\cdot s}{s\\cdot s&#39;}\\land\\frac{r}{s}\\cdot\\frac{r&#39;}{s&#39;}=\\frac{r\\cdot r&#39;}{s\\cdot s&#39;}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^{-1}R\">\\(S^{-1}R\\)</span> is universal among rings with maps from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> that invert <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S = R \\setminus \\mathfrak{p}\">\\(S = R \\setminus \\mathfrak{p}\\)</span> gives localization at prime <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{p}\">\\(\\mathfrak{p}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^{-1}R = 0\">\\(S^{-1}R = 0\\)</span> iff <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0 \\in S\">\\(0 \\in S\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Localization is exact: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^{-1}(\\cdots)\">\\(S^{-1}(\\cdots)\\)</span> is an exact 